<title>CANADA: Nortel in talks on Japanese contracts.</title>
<headline>Nortel in talks on Japanese contracts.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Telecom Ltd is in the running for a couple of equipment contracts in Japan with an unnamed consortium.</p>
<p>&quot;That's to build telephony over cable,&quot; president and chief executive Jean Monty said in a recent interview.</p>
<p>He declined to give any other details but said the Japanese market is finally showing some signs of loosening up.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
